    "notes": "A boss. msm:boss_bar shows its health in a red bar with 12 notches to every player within 64 blocks (range), darkens the sky and fogs the world; a boss never despawns. It has 300 health, cannot be knocked back (knockback_resistance 1), ignores fire and hits for 15 damage. It has no spawn field, so it never spawns on its own: summon it with its spawn egg or /summon. scale 2 draws the model twice as big, and its hitbox is twice the biped's.",
